      "description": "Orianna's Abilities originate from her <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Ball</span>. Orianna's <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Ball</span> automatically returns to her if she is too far away from it.<br /><br />Orianna's Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15% Ability Power) magic damage</span>. Subsequent Attacks against the same target within 4 seconds deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(2.25% Ability Power) magic damage</span> (max of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15% Ability Power) damage</span>).",
